&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第1章 陨落的天才&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第2章 白毛伪娘师父原来是废物软屌小骚货，把他收做伪娘性奴大做特做吧&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第3章 伪娘师尊药梣的淫荡炼药教学，成人仪式大显身手把势利眼妹妹萧媚震慑倾心，展示身份收服金发旗袍御姐雅妃&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章 一枪挑三雌，把巨乳学姐雪妮，发情痴女导师若琳还有闷骚淫贱的表姐萧玉操到臣服，跪成一排掰开小穴任你挑选&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章 魔兽山脉历练，对着小医仙耍流氓素股调戏之后，居然被痴女云韵狠狠地骑乘强奸了？！！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六章 被发情云韵追着的萧炎，又撩拨上了白虎处女小医仙，厄难毒体发作下，初尝肉味的少女竟是这番表现令人震惊！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章 用双修炉鼎厄难毒体的小医仙突破大牝师，拿被调教到百依百顺的白毛伪娘师父泄欲&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章 淫荡的厄难毒体被完全开发，清纯少女小医仙沦落为渴精母狗，为求大鸡巴临幸主动做双修炉鼎供男人采补&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第9章 漠城初遇黑皮男娘海波东，强如牝皇也只能在药梣的助纣为&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第10章 晨炮双飞药梣海波东两骚货后，萧炎寻火遇碧眼蛇裔清纯&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章 沙漠里被操到子宫鼓胀的贱蛇统领月媚，昔日高傲骚货哭着求饶还主动翘尾巴掰穴求后入，最后沦为只会喷水求种的专属孕母畜肉便器&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/quan-shi-ji-ba-tao-zi-de-dou-po-cang-qiong-4g57/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章 美杜莎女王进化之后变成了奇怪的样子，拿到青莲地心火的萧炎的胜利结算画面竟然是和云韵开云趴！&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>